<title>FINLAND: UPM-Kymmene sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>UPM-Kymmene sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy on Thursday gave the following breakdown by quarter of its sales and operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p> SALES			  I/97    IV/96   III/96  II/96   I/96</p>
<p> Magazine papers	    2,472   3,178   2,543   2,521   2,930</p>
<p> Newsprint		    1,337   1,381   1,331   1,461   1,607</p>
<p> Fine papers		  1,807   1,517   1,632   1,479   1,592</p>
<p> Packaging materials	1,423   1,389   1,262   1,411   1,411</p>
<p> Sawn timber		  1,003   1,001     945     949     830</p>
<p> Plywood			  811     802     710     830     802</p>
<p> Special products	   1,094     880     798     968     928</p>
<p> Chemical pulp		1,064   1,001     970     897   1,238</p>
<p> Other			  3,203   2,655   2,026   3,108   2,736</p>
<p> Engineering (Rauma)	2,315   3,012   2,270   2,489   2,449</p>
<p> Internal sales	    -3,443  -3,346  -2,372  -3,211  -3,253</p>
<p> TOTAL			 13,086  13,470  12,115  12,902  13,270</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT:</p>
<p> Magazine papers		114     345     591     511     625</p>
<p> Newsprint			 89     103     267     303     371</p>
<p> Fine papers		    124	33	 5	20	27</p>
<p> Packaging materials	  134     116     128     168     147</p>
<p> Sawn timber		     46	 9     -24	-3     -30</p>
<p> Plywood			   35	29	18	64	28</p>
<p> Special products		74	52	70     129	88</p>
<p> Chemical pulp (1)	    -67     -69     -90    -346     329</p>
<p> Other			  1,105     274     192     188     213</p>
<p> Engineering (Rauma)	  165     214     139     141     216</p>
<p> TOTAL			  1,819   1,106   1,296   1,175   2,014</p>
<p>(1) Includes share of results of associated companies.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0247</p>
